      "displayName": "Balance",
      "category": "standard",
      "shortDescription": "A flexible team that mixes offense, defense, utility, and speed control.",
      "userNotes": [
        "This team looks well-rounded rather than fully aggressive or fully defensive.",
        "Balance teams can usually shift between offense and defense depending on the matchup.",
        "Watch for pivoting, utility moves, speed control, and one or two strong breakers."
      ],
      "battleAdvice": [
        "Avoid overcommitting early because balance teams often have defensive answers and pivots.",
        "Identify the main breaker and the main wall first.",
        "Force the opponent to reveal whether they are playing defensively or setting up an offensive endgame."
